ce`: `google_direct_unchanged=True` (**MATCH**)\n  - Белый список изменённых файлов: `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py, bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py, bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/tests/test_step_interruption.py` (ровно 3 целевых файла `coder_target_files`).\n\n## Сводка `acceptance_coverage` из `coder.json`\n- {\"id\": \"RW-001\", \"status\": \"PASS\", \"test\": \"test_c10_rw001_drain_permission_reject_continues_and_reasoning_delivered; test_c10_rw001_drain_form_created_fails_closed_without_tool; test_c10_rw001_drain_error_classification_preserved\", \"evidence\": \"~/work/cli-agent-bridge/coder-13-20261027/green2.log; full-pytest-final.log; unittest-final2.log\"}\n- {\"id\": \"RW-002\", \"status\": \"PASS\", \"test\": \"test_c10_rw002_unconfirmed_tool_not_published_retry_b_only (SSE и JSON, MAX_TOTAL_SPAWNS=2)\", \"evidence\": \"~/work/cli-agent-bridge/coder-13-20261027/green2.log; full-pytest-final.log; unittest-final2.log\"}\n- {\"id\": \"RW-003\", \"status\": \"PASS\", \"test\": \"test_c10_rw003_reasoning_markers_preserved_text_clean; test_interrupted_artifact_removed_from_reasoning_stream/json (обновлены под raw reasoning)\", \"evidence\": \"~/work/cli-agent-bridge/coder-13-20261027/green2.log; full-pytest-final.log\"}\n- {\"id\": \"RW-004\", \"status\": \"PASS\", \"test\": \"test_c10_rw004_tool_count_and_state_bytes_caps; test_c10_rw004_tool_state_byte_cap_main_and_drain_cleanup\", \"evidence\": \"~/work/cli-agent-bridge/coder-13-20261027/green2.log; full-pytest-final.log\"}\n- {\"id\": \"RW-005\", \"status\": \"PASS\", \"test\": \"test_c10_rw005_locked_wfile_timeout_and_abort_without_lock; test_c10_rw005_slow_client_bounded_cleanup_and_slot_released (реальный сокет)\", \"evidence\": \"~/work/cli-agent-bridge/coder-13-20261027/green2.log; failed11-rerun.log; full-pytest-final.log\"}\n- {\"id\": \"FU-002\", \"status\": \"PASS\", \"test\": \"test_c10_fu002_aux_budget_three_subscriptions_deterministic; test_c10_fu002_exhausted_aux_budget_starts_no_attempt\", \"evidence\": \"~/work/cli-agent-bridge/coder-13-20261027/green2.log; unittest-c10-1..3.log\"}\n\n## Поштучная матрица `REQ-001..REQ-020` и `AC-001..AC-026`\n\n| Требование / AC | Реализация в коде | Автотесты / Оракулы | Свидетельство L2 / L3 | Статус |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `REQ-001` / `AC-001`, `AC-002`, `REQ-020` / `AC-026` (реалтайм-стриминг дельт `reasoning_content` и `content` `<=250 мс`, побайтовая сохранность маркеров в `reasoning_content`, Red→Green на сокете при идущем апстриме без падения в `setUp` на `origin/dev`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py` (`_map_serve_event` для `message.part.updated`, `_serve_one_attempt`, `_LockedWfile`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py` (`test_ac026_realtime_chunks_before_upstream_end`, `test_c10_rw003_reasoning_markers_preserved_text_clean`, `test_c10_rw005_locked_wfile_timeout_and_abort_without_lock`, `test_c10_rw005_slow_client_bounded_cleanup_and_slot_released`) | `L2-RED-sensitivity` (`rc=1` на `origin/dev`) + `VER-001-pytest` (`rc=0` на кандидате) | `PASS` |\n| `REQ-002` / `AC-003` (неизменность публичного HTTP/OpenAI SSE контракта `/health`, `/v1/models`, `/v1/chat/completions`, `:9883`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py` | `tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py` | `VER-001-pytest`, `VER-002-unittest` (`rc=0`) | `PASS` |\n| `REQ-003` / `AC-004` (kill-switch `REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED` в `dynamic_config.json`, дефолт `false`, сохранение `opencode run --format json` и `disable-serve`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py` (`DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH`, `_ServeHealth`, fallback decision table) | `tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py`, полный существующий набор `tests/` | `VER-001-pytest` (`rc=0`) | `PASS` |\n| `REQ-004`, `REQ-005` / `AC-005`, `AC-006`, `AC-007` (первая реакция `< 1.0 с` с префиксом `[мост]` и `\n`, ведущий `\n` после незавершённой дельты, побайтовая сохранность `reasoning_content`, отсутствие `[мост]` в `_messages_to_prompt`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py` | `tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py` (`test_c5_rw002_limiter_delay_half_second_still_emits_first_status_under_1s`, `test_c10_rw003_reasoning_markers_preserved_text_clean`), `tests/test_step_interruption.py` | `VER-001-pytest` (`rc=0`) | `PASS` |\n| `REQ-006`, `REQ-007` / `AC-008`, `AC-009`, `AC-010` (раздельные watchdogs `first_event_timeout`, `first_token_timeout`, `stall_timeout` с env-порогами в SSE и non-stream JSON `Run.execute` без классификации как `provider_fatal`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py` | `tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py` (`test_c7_rw001_json_run_watchdog_oexit_reason_and_phase_timings`, `test_c7_rw003_legacy_sse_watchdog_records_breaker_failure_with_and_without_output`, `test_c6_rw002_legacy_first_token_timeout_respects_configured_value_under_120s`, `test_c6_rw003_nonstream_json_run_execute_enforces_phase_watchdogs`) | `VER-001-pytest` (`rc=0`) | `PASS` |\n| `REQ-008` / `AC-011`, `AC-012` (группа процессов `--serve-helper` + `opencode serve`, ранний дренаж `stderr`, фазовые потолки `_serve_http`, общий бюджет `_AuxIoBudget` (`_AUX_IO_BUDGET_S = 54.0`), прерываемое ожидание в `_StartupGate`/`_SpawnRateLimiter` по `deadline`/`is_client_gone`, детекция закрытия сокета `<= 5 с`, `0` сирот `<= 7 с` включая `skip_body=True` на капающем `interrupt`/`DELETE`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py` (`_AuxIoBudget`, `_LockedWfile`) | `tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py` (`test_c10_fu002_aux_budget_three_subscriptions_deterministic`, `test_c10_fu002_exhausted_aux_budget_starts_no_attempt`, `test_c8_fu002_pre_spawn_gate_and_limiter_respect_deadline_and_client_disconnect`, `test_c7_rw004_startup_http_phases_enforce_own_budget_under_long_request_deadline`, `test_c6_rw005_spawn_serve_respects_deadline_and_client_disconnect_without_run_fallback`, `test_c6_rw006_spawn_serve_drains_multi_mib_stderr_before_bind_without_deadlock`, `test_c6_rw007_fu003_dripping_interrupt_delete_still_cleans_up_under_7s`) | `VER-001-pytest` (`r